<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results from the Swiss Open on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat 4-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>2-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 6-2 3-2 retired</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefter (Germany) beat Richey Reneberg (S.) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>7-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 7-6 (7-2) 1-6 7-5</p>
</text>
